  "_note": "Cue ids match content/ui-strings style: they describe the EVENT, not the sound, so a clip can be swapped without touching game code. Several cues take numbered variants; the player picks among them at random so a sound heard 60 times a game doesn't wear out. Frequent cues are held under ~100ms on purpose: select_003..006 are the same sound with long tails, and at 40-80 plays a game a tail is what turns a cue into an irritation. A cue listed as __own__ has no default and is supplied from sfx-src/.",
